---
layout: base.njk
title: Help
description: How to use Deaftly, from your first message to templates, Show, Face to face, Side by side and the camera.
---
<div class="wrap help">
{% include "help-menu.njk" %}
<div class="help__content">
<h1>How can we help?</h1>
<form class="help-search" role="search" action="/help/" method="get" hidden>
<label for="help-q">Search help</label>
<div class="help-search__row">
<input id="help-q" name="q" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="For example: change text size">
<button class="button" type="submit">Search</button>
</div>
</form>
<div id="help-results" class="help-results" aria-live="polite"></div>
<ul class="topic-grid">
{% for topic in help %}
<li><a class="situation-card" href="{{ topic.url }}"><strong>{{ topic.title }}</strong></a></li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
<div class="panel help-contact">
<h2>Still stuck, or found a bug?</h2>
<p>Send us feedback or report a bug. Tell us your app version if you can.</p>
<a class="button" href="/feedback/">Get in touch</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<script src="{{ "/scripts/help-search.js" | asset }}" defer></script>
